          "text": "我觉得女性最大的魅力\nI think the greatest charm of women\n不是世俗的漂亮\nNot worldly beauty\n也不是母爱的爆棚\nIt's not a burst of maternal love either\n要有敢于按自己的信念\nHave the courage to follow your own beliefs\n\n而是在冷风中坚强\nBut to be strong in the cold wind\n以及坚强的自我意识\nAnd a strong sense of self-awareness\n在爱中依然清醒\nStill sober in love\n是历经苦难后保持对生活的热爱\nMaintaining a love for life after experiencing hardships\n\n我爱女性角色\nI love female characters\n爱她们成熟的思想\nLove their mature thoughts\n独立的灵魂\nAn independent soul\n女性独立则天地皆宽\nWomen's independence makes the world better.\n\n可是我在哈佛这三年\nbut in my three years at Harvard,\n发现激情是修读和实践法律\nI have come to find that passion is a key ingredient\n的关键因素也是生命的要素\nto the study and practice of law and of life.\n是激情 坚守信念的勇气\nIt is with passion, courage of conviction.\n以及强大的自我意识带领让我们走进人生的下一阶段\nand strong sense of self that we take our next steps into the world.\n记住 第一印象不一定是对的\nRemembering that first impressions are not always correct;\n要永远对人保持信心\nyou must always have faith in people;\n而最重要的\nand most importantly,\n要永远对自己有信心\nyou must always have faith in yourself."
